title: Root Scene
new-page: true
go-to: post_event if started = 1; start_menu if started = 0

@start_menu
new-page: true
go-to: start_menu_2

= PPS: An Alternate History

**Playable-slice notice:** You play as the **PPS (Polska Partia Socjalistyczna)**. The January 1922 opening, November 1922 Sejm election, December 1922 presidential succession, electoral parties, support model, factions, advisers and PPS self-defence organization are implemented Polish slices. Most action cards, dated events and later governments remain an unfinished German-baseline simulation. After December 1922, May 1928 is the temporary next election date, not a researched Polish chronology. There is no campaign cutoff.

@start_menu_2

- @start: Start game
- @election_simulation: Election simulation
- @credits: Credits
- @game_over.achievements


@start
call: polish_opening_state
on-arrival: {!
