= January 1922

The campaign begins in January 1922.

Naczelnik Państwa: **Józef Piłsudski**. Prime minister: **Antoni Ponikowski**. Legislature: **Sejm Ustawodawczy**.

PPS provides external toleration, without cabinet membership or ministry control. The opening, November 1922 Sejm election and December presidential succession are implemented. May 1928 is the temporary next parliamentary election; later governments, later presidential chronology and unconverted mechanics remain unfinished.
